            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.23.3+DEU.23.4+DEU.23.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bir 23:3-5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha kiro eki, bakasoma ekitabu kya Musa, abantu boona bategere amatu; haasangwamu ekyahandiikirwe ekirukugamba kiti: Hatalibaho Omwamooni rundi Omumowabbu ow'alitaaha omu kitebe kya Ruhanga; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.22.1+NUM.22.2+NUM.22.3+NUM.22.4+NUM.22.5+NUM.22.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kubar 22:1-6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "habwokuba abantu b'Amooni n'aba Mowabbu batahe Baisirairi omugaati n'amaizi, obu bakaba nibaruga Misiri, baitu bakaboohera Balaamu abakyeene baitu Ruhanga waitu omukyeeno akagwihamu omugisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu obu baahuliire ekiragiro eki, baasoroora abanyamahanga boona, baabaiha omu Baisirairi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eki kitakabaireho, Eryasibbu ow'akaba akomerwe okurolerra ebisiika eby'enju ya Ruhanga waitu kandi ow'akaba ali nganjani ya Tobbiya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akateekaniriza Tobbiya ekisiika ekigalihiire, kara eki bakaba batairemu ekihongwa eky'ebyokulya, obubbaani, ebikwato, n'ebicweka eby'ikumi eby'engano, eviini n'amagita, ebyaheebwaga Abaleevi, abazini, n'abalinzi, ekiragiro nkooku kikaba nikiragira, kandi eki baayahuramuga ebihongwa ebya banyakatagara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eki nambere kyabeeriireho, nyowe nkaba ntali Yerusaalemu, habwokuba omu mwaka ogw'amakumi asatu n'ebiri ogw'engoma ya Atagizakiseesi omukama wa Bbabbulooni, nkagenda mb'omukama ogu. Obu haahingwireho akasumi nkasaba omukama orusa ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "naija Yerusaalemu, obu nubwo nazoire akabi Eryasibbu aka akaba anagiremu Tobbiya, ak'okumuteekaniriza ekisiika omu bikaali by'enju ya Ruhanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekiniga kikenda kunyita, nukwo kuhungura aheeru ebintu byona ebikaba biri omu kisiika kya Tobbiya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma naragira abantu, baasemeza ebisiika; nukwo nagarramu ebikwato eby'enju ya Ruhanga, hamu n'ekihongwa eky'ebyokulya, n'obubbani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
